{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.GravitySpectralPrefactor","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.GravitySpectralPrefactor","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.tailSpectralRatio_eq_of_borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.tailSpectralRatio_eq_of_borromean","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L74-L83","doc":"The ratio recovers whatever constant the prefactor was built from: if\n`α = m_e · 8 · c` then `G_q = c`.  With `c` Catalan's constant this is\nthe link to `conj:binding-scale-catalan`, and it is what makes the\ncoefficient `8` a statement about `Vol(𝓑₃)` rather than a free choice. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.gravity_spectral_prefactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.gravity_spectral_prefactor","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L63-L72","doc":"**Proposition (prefactor extraction is well-posed).**\n\n`α = m_e · 8 · G_q` for the ratio `G_q` defined above.  This is the\nunfolding of `tailSpectralRatio`; it says the extraction inverts\ncleanly for a positive ruler, and does not derive `α`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:gravity-spectral-prefactor","label":"prop:gravity-spectral-prefactor","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.tailSpectralRatio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.tailSpectralRatio","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L55-L61","doc":"The dimensionless tail spectral ratio extracted from the prefactor:\n`G_q = α / (8 · m_e)`.\n\nUnder the Catalan reading this equals Catalan's constant exactly when\n`α = m_e · Vol(𝓑₃)`; see `tailSpectralRatio_eq_of_borromean`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.m_e_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.m_e_pos","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The ruler is a positive scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.m_e","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Electron mass (the ruler fixed by CAL-1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.α","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.α","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Prefactor on the deep-tower stratum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.UniversalResidue","kind":"structure","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/gravity-spectral-prefactor.lean#L46-L53","doc":"The universal-residue prefactor of the unified mass formula. ","signatureChunk":0}]}